## Side-by-side scorecard (mean ± stddev across N runs)

| Adapter             | Family              | Runs | Queries | P@5 (mean ± sd)    | R@5 (mean ± sd)    |
|---------------------|---------------------|------|---------|---------------------|---------------------|
| gbrain              | relational          |    3 |     145 |               34.2% |               97.9% |
| vector-grep-rrf-fusion | relational          |    3 |     145 |          19.2% ±0.0 |               68.7% |
| vector-grep-rrf-fusion | fuzzy               |    3 |      24 |               11.7% |               58.3% |
| vector-grep-rrf-fusion | externally-authored |    3 |      47 |               19.6% |               84.0% |
| grep-only           | relational          |    3 |     145 |               17.1% |               62.4% |
| grep-only           | fuzzy               |    3 |      24 |               15.8% |               79.2% |
| grep-only           | externally-authored |    3 |      47 |               19.6% |               85.1% |
| vector              | relational          |    3 |     145 |               10.8% |               40.7% |
| vector              | fuzzy               |    3 |      24 |               11.7% |               58.3% |
| vector              | externally-authored |    3 |      47 |          20.9% ±0.0 |          89.4% ±0.0 |

*Stddev = 0 means the adapter is deterministic over page ordering. Non-zero stddev surfaces order-dependent bugs (e.g. tie-break that favors first-seen slug). LLM-judge-based metrics will produce non-zero stddev once added.*

