## Methodology

- Corpus: 240 rich-prose fictional pages (eval/data/world-v1/).
- [relational] 145 gold-bearing queries scored, 0 excluded (empty gold.relevant).
- [fuzzy] 24 gold-bearing queries scored, 6 excluded (empty gold.relevant).
- [externally-authored] 47 gold-bearing queries scored, 3 excluded (empty gold.relevant).
- Metrics: mean P@5 and R@5 per family (eval/runner/metrics.ts denominators).
- Top-K: 5 (what agents actually read in ranked results).
- Each adapter reingests raw pages. No gold data visible to adapters.

